HIGH-PROFILE BRIEFINGS BEGIN ON

00:00:01.287 --> 00:00:02.755
THE

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.390
THE HILL END OF THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:00:02.888 --> 00:00:05.925
THERE WAS NO IMMEDIATE RESPONSE

00:00:04.523 --> 00:00:06.358
FROM McCABE'S LAWYER OR THE

00:00:06.058 --> 00:00:07.560
BUREAU, BRET.

00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:09.762
&gt;&gt; Bret: THANK YOU.

00:00:07.693 --> 00:00:10.996
IT'S BEEN ANOTHER TRAGIC WEEK

00:00:09.895 --> 00:00:13.866
FOR U.S. MILITARY AVIATION.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:15.301
FIVE SERVICE MEMBERS HAVE DIED

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:16.669
AND THE ACCIDENTS ARE

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:17.403
CONTINUING.

00:00:16.802 --> 00:00:18.871
NATIONAL SECURITY CORRESPONDENT

00:00:17.536 --> 00:00:19.738
JENNIFER GRIFFIN IS AT THE

00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:21.907
PENTAGON WITH THE FALLOUT.

00:00:19.872 --> 00:00:23.275
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, BRET.

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:25.878
LATE TODAY, THE AIR FORCE

00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:27.913
IDENTIFIED THE PILOT KILLED IN

00:00:26.011 --> 00:00:28.481
YESTERDAY'S F-16 COAT, CRASHED

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:30.082
OUTSIDE LAS VEGAS.

00:00:28.614 --> 00:00:32.485
HE FLEW FOR THE ELITE

00:00:30.216 --> 00:00:33.419
THUNDERBIRDS, HAD MORE THAN 3500

00:00:32.618 --> 00:00:35.321
FLYING HOURS AND 30

00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:37.523
DIFFERENT TYPES OF PLANES.

00:00:35.454 --> 00:00:38.791
HE WAS VERY EXPERIENCED, YET HAS

00:00:37.656 --> 00:00:41.260
SPIDERED JET CRASHED DURING A

00:00:38.924 --> 00:00:43.696
ROUTINE TRAINING FLIGHT.

00:00:41.393 --> 00:00:45.664
IT MARKS THE THIRD CRASH FOR THE

00:00:43.829 --> 00:00:47.266
THUNDERBIRDS IN LESS THAN TWO

00:00:45.798 --> 00:00:48.367
YEARS, AND THE THIRD MILITARY

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:49.368
AIRCRAFT TO CRASH IN THE PAST

00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:51.136
TWO DAYS.

00:00:49.502 --> 00:00:53.706
ON TUESDAY, A MARINE CORE SUPER

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:55.608
STALLION HELICOPTER CRASHED

00:00:53.839 --> 00:00:56.308
IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA, KILLING

00:00:55.741 --> 00:00:58.511
FOUR MARINES.

00:00:56.442 --> 00:01:00.913
EARLIER THAT DAY, IN THE EAST

00:00:58.644 --> 00:01:02.214
AFRICAN NATION OF DJIBOUTI, A

00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:02.548
MARINE CARRIER JET CRASHED ON

00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:04.483
TAKEOFF.

00:01:02.681 --> 00:01:06.519
THE PILOT EJECTED AND WAS

00:01:04.617 --> 00:01:07.520
RELEASED FROM THE HOSPITAL BUT

00:01:06.652 --> 00:01:09.422
TODAY, THE DJIBOUTI GOVERNMENT

00:01:07.653 --> 00:01:11.290
GROUNDED ALL U.S. MILITARY

00:01:09.555 --> 00:01:13.693
FLIGHTS INCLUDING DRONES FROM

00:01:11.424 --> 00:01:14.727
THE LARGEST AMERICAN BASE IN

00:01:13.826 --> 00:01:15.895
AFRICA, HINDERING

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.596
COUNTERTERRORISM OPERATIONS.

00:01:16.028 --> 00:01:19.865
THERE HAVE BEEN FIVE NONCOMBAT

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:20.566
AVIATION CRASHES THIS YEAR

00:01:19.999 --> 00:01:21.100
ALONE, KILLING NINE

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:23.069
SERVICE MEMBERS.

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:23.703
37 WERE KILLED IN AIR CRASHES

00:01:23.202 --> 00:01:26.505
LAST YEAR.

00:01:23.836 --> 00:01:26.839
NEARLY DOUBLE THE NUMBER KILLED

00:01:26.639 --> 00:01:28.341
IN 2016.

00:01:26.972 --> 00:01:30.976
BUT A TOP GENERAL AT THE

00:01:28.474 --> 00:01:31.310
PENTAGON WOULD NOT CALL IT A

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:35.815
CRISIS.

00:01:31.444 --> 00:01:37.083
&gt;&gt; I WOULD REJECT IT'S A CRISIS.

00:01:35.948 --> 00:01:38.484
THOSE ARE MISHAPS THAT OCCURRED.

00:01:37.216 --> 00:01:39.285
WE WILL LOOK AT EACH ONE IN

00:01:38.618 --> 00:01:39.885
TURN.

00:01:39.418 --> 00:01:40.686
EACH ONE IS TRAGIC.

00:01:40.019 --> 00:01:42.121
WE REGRET EACH ONE.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:44.090
WE WILL LOOK AT THEM CAREFULLY.

00:01:42.255 --> 00:01:45.725
I'M NOT PREPARED TO SAY IT'S A

00:01:44.223 --> 00:01:46.058
WAVE OF MISHAPS OR SOME FORM OF

00:01:45.858 --> 00:01:48.527
CRISIS.

00:01:46.192 --> 00:01:49.528
&gt;&gt; THE HOUSE ARMED SERVICES

00:01:48.661 --> 00:01:51.864
CHAIRMAN WARNED THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:49.662 --> 00:01:52.565
NOT TO ROB THE MILITARY'S

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:55.901
READINESS MONEY TO FUND THE

00:01:52.698 --> 00:01:57.336
NATIONAL GUARD AT THE BORDER.

00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:59.105
PRESIDENT GEORGE W. BUSH SENT A

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:02.308
6,000 TROOPS TO THE MEXICO

00:01:59.238 --> 00:02:03.676
BORDER, IT COST $415 MILLION,

00:02:02.441 --> 00:02:05.478
MONEY THAT WAS STRIPPED FROM THE

00:02:03.809 --> 00:02:06.912
AIR FORCE AND NAVY'S OPERATIONS

00:02:05.611 --> 00:02:09.448
AND MAINTENANCE BUDGET.

00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:10.983
THE PENTAGON JUST RECEIVED

00:02:09.582 --> 00:02:11.484
$700 BILLION, A SIZABLE PORTION

00:02:11.117 --> 00:02:14.086
OF THAT.

00:02:11.617 --> 00:02:15.655
IT IS SUPPOSED TO HELP FIX

